{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Huffman tree of the weights: a binary tree whose leaves are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<n"},{"type":"text","text":", the weights’"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offsets, in which the sum over the leaves of weight times depth is least. Each step"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"joins the two lightest trees under a new vertex, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n + 1"},{"type":"text","text":", … in turn, the lighter as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the left child; on a tie a leaf goes before a joined tree, and earlier ones before later."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The root is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"2n − 2"},{"type":"text","text":", or the lone leaf 0. Reading left as 0 and right as 1 down to a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leaf gives its code word."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees","doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/BinaryTree"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees\/BinaryTree\/huffman(weights:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trees\/binarytree\/huffman(weights:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"huffman"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"weights"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST","text":"Sequence"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trees\/documentation\/Trees